"""Detect 'in' and its translations, mostly from the current token spelling.

Left word boundaries suppress obvious fragments inside an existing word.
For ambiguous Latin spellings (Spanish 'en', Portuguese 'em', Polish 'w',
Czech/Slovak 'v', German 'im'), recent words' dictionary frequencies choose
between the relevant languages. English locative phrases are stronger than
