Negation raises the prediction; Chinese enumerations, modal verbs, collective
person nouns and progress/aspiration words lower it. Context-free openings
have a negative offset, retained through identical opening tokens. The initial
decimal prefix '12' is a separate, reproducible boundary exception.
These rules do not capture all the rare context-dependent activation peaks.
