Positive: particles in light-verb phrases, especially give/grow/keep up.
Negative: noun complements such as take care, make use, and get hold.
There are also responses to grep and several G-initial technical names,
a negative response to i-initial pieces immediately after G or H,
and the colon of a document-initial Title: label.
